<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367633/eurocert/F16.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="Non-GMO"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Verified Non-Genetically Modified Product Certification</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Non-GMO<!-- --> <span class="text-eurogold-400">Products</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Non-GMO product verification certification provides independent third-party assurance that products and ingredients are produced without genetic engineering, meeting growing consumer demand for transparency and natural food choices.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Non-GMO<!-- --> <span class="text-euro-600">Products Certification</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Non-GMO certification verifies that products and their ingredients are produced without genetic engineering and that proper segregation practices are maintained throughout the supply chain. With growing consumer demand for transparency and natural food choices, Non-GMO certification has become increasingly important for food manufacturers, retailers, and ingredient suppliers seeking to meet market expectations.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-info-circle text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What is Non-GMO Product Certification?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Non-GMO (Genetically Modified Organism) certification is an independent verification process that confirms products do not contain genetically modified ingredients. The certification involves rigorous testing, traceability verification, and supply chain audits to ensure that non-GMO integrity is maintained from farm to finished product, typically meeting the EU threshold of less than 0.9% GMO content.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 flex h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784090956/non_pfcmhs.png" class="w-full h-full transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105 object-cover" alt="Non-GMO"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Our<!-- --> <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Product Certification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Complete product certification services verifying that finished products meet non-GMO standards through testing and documentation review.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-link text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supply Chain Verification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Rigorous verification of supply chain integrity ensuring non-GMO status is maintained from raw material sourcing through manufacturing.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-flask text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Testing &amp; Analysis</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">GMO testing of raw materials and finished products using accredited laboratories to verify compliance with non-GMO thresholds.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-tag text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Labeling Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Assessment and verification of labeling compliance for non-GMO claims across target markets and regulatory requirements.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Documentation Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Support in developing and maintaining traceability documentation, segregation protocols, and compliance records.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Ongoing Monitoring</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Continuous monitoring and surveillance programs including periodic audits and testing to maintain certification status.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Certification Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of <span class="text-euro-600">Certification</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-users text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Consumer Demand</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Meet the growing consumer preference for non-GMO products with independent third-party verification that builds trust.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-tag text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Market Differentiation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Stand out in the marketplace with verified non-GMO claims that resonate with health-conscious consumers.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Label Credibility</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Build consumer confidence with independent verification of your non-GMO claims and product integrity.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Supply Chain Trust</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Strengthen relationships with retailers and buyers through verified supply chain transparency.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Premium Positioning</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Non-GMO certified products often command premium prices in health-conscious and natural market segments.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Certification Partner</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Choose Eurocert for <span class="text-eurogold-400">Non-GMO<!-- -->?</span></h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Expert Certification</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our certification team brings extensive experience in GMO testing, supply chain verification, and non-GMO standards. We provide thorough audits, clear guidance on segregation protocols, and practical support to help you achieve and maintain non-GMO certification across your product portfolio.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-globe-asia text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Why Eurocert Asia?</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia offers comprehensive Non-GMO verification services with rigorous testing and audit protocols. Our certification is recognized internationally and helps you demonstrate commitment to product integrity while meeting regulatory requirements in the EU and other markets.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">100%</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Success Rate</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-[#f8fafc] py-10 lg:py-12"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"></div></div><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/food-certification/non-gmo-animal-feed/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367640/eurocert/F17.png.png&#x